 "description": "<p>Rose red and pink are the two finishes, and beneath the color choice sits an unusually complete spec: nine frequency vibrations, nine rotation patterns, and a neutral holding mode, all running from a 188-gram body that measures 195 by 58 millimeters. The weight is the sweet spot — enough presence to feel solid, light enough for extended handling.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"rose toy clit sucker vibrator red\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0772/6311/0453/files/rosetoyclitsuckervibratorred_4_753edbaa-71a6-48ab-a8bc-4346595c9e75_480x480.jpg?v=1692065164\"></p>\n<p>The rotation patterns are the differentiator. Rather than buzzing in place, the head turns in small orbits that sweep contact across a wider arc — useful where direct fixed contact goes numb, which for most users happens sooner than they expect.</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0772/6311/0453/files/rosetoyclitsuckervibratorred_6_51589b02-3c02-4e51-8507-28aef04c8877_480x480.jpg?v=1692065170\" alt=\"rose toy clit sucker vibrator red\"></p>\n<p>Battery details are printed plainly: a 3.7V 320mAh lithium cell, eighty minutes to full, forty to sixty-five minutes of play, and a 58 dB ceiling while running. The magnetic USB contact makes the charging part automatic.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"rose toy clit sucker vibrator red\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0772/6311/0453/files/rosetoyclitsuckervibratorred_9_ee422eec-f834-4dbb-8bfb-c330693649a8_480x480.jpg?v=1692065181\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Vibration modes: 9 frequencies + 9 rotation patterns + neutral mode</li>\n<li>Colors: Rose Red and Pink</li>\n<li>Size: 195 x 58 mm; weight 188.2 g</li>\n<li>Battery: 3.7 V / 320 mAh lithium, 80 min charge</li>\n<li>Working time: 40–65 minutes</li>\n<li>Noise: 58 dB max; waterproof IPX7</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img alt=\"rose toy clit sucker vibrator red\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0772/6311/0453/files/rosetoyclitsuckervibratorred_3_480x480.jpg?v=1692065161\"><br />\n<img alt=\"rose toy